Subject: [PATCH 11/13] xrandr: adopt XRandR 1.5 logical monitors

Replace legacy output/CRTC probing with `XRRGetMonitors`.
Leverage logical monitor boundaries for multi-display setups.
Fixes ignored user-defined monitors and eliminates resource leaks.
---
 src/xrandr.c | 94 +++++++++++++++++++++++++---------------------------
 1 file changed, 45 insertions(+), 49 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/xrandr.c b/src/xrandr.c
index 5ddf082..8ff15e7 100644
--- a/src/xrandr.c
+++ b/src/xrandr.c
@@ -28,7 +28,7 @@
