Subject: [PATCH 13/13] gap: add configurable window spacing and document it

Introduce a new `gap` variable to control uniform spacing (in pixels)
between windows and their containing frames.

* Core: add `gap` field to `rp_defaults`, initialize to 0, and
  integrate into frame sizing, window placement, and maximize logic.
* Commands: add `set gap` handler with validation and runtime update
  of visible windows.
* Layout: adjust frame resize functions to respect `gap` in minimum
  size checks.
* Docs: update `ratpoison.mdoc.1` and `ratpoison.texi` to describe the
  `gap` variable, its usage, and default value.

This feature enables "window gaps" similar to other tiling managers,
providing visual separation between tiled windows while remaining
configurable.
